          "body": "<div><div><p>The city has announced film, theatre and activities at the venue. I would check the current municipal programme for what is running, the date and admission. For exhibitions, also check Espaço Cultural Zanine; shows change and are not permanent.</p><div class=\"bz-editorial-actions\"><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Cine%20Teatro%20Rasa%2C%20Arma%C3%A7%C3%A3o%20dos%20B%C3%BAzios\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Open in Maps →</a></div></div></div>",
