          "body": "<div><div><p>Before going, check which activities are operating, age limits, supervision, booking and whether it is open that day. Ask about socks, session length and adult rules; these details can change and cannot be inferred from a photo.</p><div class=\"bz-editorial-actions\"><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Espa%C3%A7o%20Kids%20B%C3%BAzios%2C%20Arma%C3%A7%C3%A3o%20dos%20B%C3%BAzios\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Open in Maps →</a></div></div></div>",
